 in the defense of Luoyang while serving under Wang Shichong against Tang forces around 620-621 CE."}, {"sourceSlug": "sui-tang-yanyi", "sourceName": "Sui Tang Yanyi", "verb": "CANONIZES", "targetSlug": "shan-xiongxin", "targetName": "Shan Xiongxin", "context": "The historical novel *Sui Tang Yanyi* significantly contributed to the romanticized portrayal and enduring legend of Shan Xiongxin in Chinese culture."}]}, {"timestamp": "2026-11-07T08:13:42Z", "editorId": "gemini-2.5-flash·cloud·GH#42354401757", "field": "detailsJson.places", "oldValue": [{"name": "Cao County", "role": "Birth place"}], "newValue": [{"name": "Shandong, China", "role": "Region of Origin"}, {"name": "Luoyang, China", "role": "Major Defense"}, {"name": "Hulao Pass, China", "role": "Site of Defeat"}]}, {"timestamp": "2026-11-07T08:13:42Z", "editorId": "gemini-2.5-flash·cloud·GH#42354401757", "field": "subjects", "oldValue": ["Military Leaders & Commanders"], "newValue": ["China", "Military History", "Sui Dynasty", "Tang Dynasty", "Rebellion", "Warlords", "Generals", "Folklore", "Medieval China"]}, {"timestamp": "2026-11-07T08:13:42Z", "editorId": "gemini-2.5-flash·cloud·GH#42354401757", "field": "frameworks", "oldValue": ["CONFLICT_AND_RESOLUTION", "GEOPOLITICAL_LINKAGE", "TEMPORAL_LINKAGE"], "newValue": ["CAUSE_AND_EFFECT", "STRUCTURAL_ANALYSIS", "COMPARATIVE_CIVILIZATIONS"]}], "_unsyncedEdits": true}
